recommend keep-going the queue now names read_the_appeal at 27 rungs by 56 lines, 1456 carried, with refer_the_quarrel at 21 by 72 behind it -- read_the_appeal is the better crux on carried lines; hash the family before trusting the count, and read the reach closure before choosing scope, since this lap proved a reach graph names a cluster where a queue names only a family
